function renderEntities(){for(const e of entities){if(!e.alive)continue;const sx=e.x-(cam.x-W/2),sy=e.y-(cam.y-H/2);if(sx<-60||sx>W+60||sy<-60||sy>H+60)continue;
    if(['Moonbloom','Sunberry','Shard'].includes(e.kind)){ctx.save();ctx.translate(e.x,e.y);ctx.fillStyle='rgba(16,36,27,.28)';ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(0,7,10,4,0,0,TAU);ctx.fill();if(e.kind==='Moonbloom'){ctx.strokeStyle='#7fa575';ctx.lineWidth=2;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(0,6);ctx.lineTo(0,-5);ctx.stroke();ctx.fillStyle='#d9dfaa';for(let i=0;i<5;i++){ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(Math.cos(i*TAU/5)*5,-7+Math.sin(i*TAU/5)*5,3,4,i*TAU/5,0,TAU);ctx.fill();}ctx.fillStyle='#e6bb76';ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(0,-7,2.1,0,TAU);ctx.fill();}else if(e.kind==='Sunberry'){ctx.fillStyle='#426943';ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(0,1,8,6,0,0,TAU);ctx.fill();ctx.fillStyle='#d47759';ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(-3,-2,3,0,TAU);ctx.arc(3,0,3,0,TAU);ctx.fill();ctx.fillStyle='#b9cc83';ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(0,-6,3,1.5,-.4,0,TAU);ctx.fill();}else{ctx.fillStyle='#96cbd0';ctx.shadowColor='#9ce1d7';ctx.shadowBlur=12;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(0,-10);ctx.lineTo(6,-2);ctx.lineTo(2,7);ctx.lineTo(-5,5);ctx.lineTo(-7,-3);ctx.closePath();ctx.fill();ctx.shadowBlur=0;}ctx.restore();continue;}
    if(e.kind==='enemy'){drawCreature(e.x,e.y,e.species,.9,Math.sin(tick/450+e.phase)*.08);if(e.aggro||close(player,e)<115){ctx.fillStyle='rgba(22,28,25,.72)';ctx.fillRect(e.x-16,e.y-25,32,4);ctx.fillStyle='#e78668';ctx.fillRect(e.x-15,e.y-24,30*clamp(e.hp/e.maxHp,0,1),2);if(close(player,e)<170){ctx.fillStyle='#eadfc7';ctx.font='9px DM Mono';ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.fillText(e.species,e.x,e.y-31);}}continue;}
    if(e.kind==='npc'){ctx.fillStyle='rgba(15,35,28,.32)';ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(e.x,e.y+12,14,6,0,0,TAU);ctx.fill();ctx.fillStyle='#e2bc8e';ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(e.x,e.y-8,7,0,TAU);ctx.fill();ctx.fillStyle='#c9a877';ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(e.x,e.y-10,8,Math.PI,TAU);ctx.fill();ctx.fillStyle='#738a74';ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(e.x-9,e.y-2);ctx.lineTo(e.x+9,e.y-2);ctx.lineTo(e.x+7,e.y+11);ctx.lineTo(e.x-7,e.y+11);ctx.fill();if(close(player,e)<150){ctx.fillStyle='#f0dfa5';ctx.font='10px DM Sans';ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.fillText('✦  Elder Rowan',e.x,e.y-26);}}
  }}
function drawAtmosphere(){for(let i=0;i<24;i++){let x=(seeded(i+tick/1600)*W+Math.sin(tick/1300+i)*25),y=(seeded(i+tick/2100+77)*H+Math.cos(tick/1500+i)*16);ctx.globalAlpha=.22+.14*Math.sin(tick/500+i);ctx.fillStyle=i%4?'#d7e3ab':'#f3d9a1';ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(x,y,i%4===0?2:1,0,TAU);ctx.fill();}ctx.globalAlpha=1;}
function render(){ctx.clearRect(0,0,W,H);cam.x+=(player.x-cam.x)*.12;cam.y+=(player.y-cam.y)*.12;paintGround();worldTransform();renderEntities();drawPlayer();ctx.restore();drawAtmosphere();if(player.attack>0){ctx.save();ctx.translate(W/2,H/2);ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,230,166,.8)';ctx.lineWidth=3;ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(0,0,34,player.dir-.9,player.dir+.9);ctx.stroke();ctx.restore();}}
function dist(e){return close(player,e);}
function closest(filter,max=95){let best=null,d=max;for(const e of entities)if(e.alive&&filter(e)){const n=dist(e);if(n<d){best=e;d=n;}}return best;}
function terrainWater(x,y){return ((x-2300)/322)**2+((y-765)/548)**2<1||Math.abs(x-(900+Math.sin(y/260)*90))<30;}
function getMoveSpeed(){let s=player.speed;if(keys.has('shift'))s*=1.6;if(mounted){let mount=species[team[active].name].mount;s*=mount==='sprint'?1.9:mount==='flight'?1.75:mount==='swim'?1.5:1.55;}if(terrainWater(player.x,player.y)&&(!mounted||species[team[active].name].mount!=='swim'))s*=.53;return s;}
function move(dt){let dx=(keys.has('d')||keys.has('arrowright')?1:0)-(keys.has('a')||keys.has('arrowleft')?1:0),dy=(keys.has('s')||keys.has('arrowdown')?1:0)-(keys.has('w')||keys.has('arrowup')?1:0);let n=Math.hypot(dx,dy);player.moving=n>0;if(n){dx/=n;dy/=n;player.dir=Math.atan2(dy,dx);let speed=getMoveSpeed()*(player.dodge>0?2.7:1);player.x=clamp(player.x+dx*speed*dt,90,2860);player.y=clamp(player.y+dy*speed*dt,90,1900);}if(player.dodge>0)player.dodge-=dt;if(player.invuln>0)player.invuln-=dt;if(player.attack>0)player.attack-=dt;if(skillCooldown>0)skillCooldown-=dt;if(attackCooldown>0)attackCooldown-=dt;}
function updateEnemies(dt){for(const e of entities){if(!e.alive||e.kind!=='enemy')continue;let d=dist(e);if(d<215)e.aggro=true;else if(d>360)e.aggro=false;if(e.aggro&&d>34){let dx=(player.x-e.x)/d,dy=(player.y-e.y)/d;e.x+=dx*e.speed*dt;e.y+=dy*e.speed*dt;}if(e.aggro&&d<39&&player.invuln<=0){player.hp-=9*dt;if(player.hp<=0){player.hp=player.maxHp;player.x=1100;player.y=680;toast('You made it back to the trailhead.');}}}}
function updateUI(){const area=areaAt(player.x);ui('location-name').textContent=area==='Mosslight Meadow'?'Mosslight Meadow':area;ui('location-name').parentElement.querySelector('.location-sub').textContent=area==='Whisperwood'?'Old trees remember every footstep.':area==='Glasswater Shore'?'Clear water, strange lights below.':'A quiet place to begin again.';ui('health-text').textContent=`${Math.ceil(player.hp)} / ${player.maxHp}`;ui('health-bar').style.width=`${100*player.hp/player.maxHp}%`;ui('xp-text').textContent=`${player.xp} / ${80+(player.level-1)*35}`;ui('xp-bar').style.width=`${100*player.xp/(80+(player.level-1)*35)}%`;ui('coins').textContent=player.coins;ui('orb-count').textContent=player.orbs;ui('team-count').textContent=`${team.length} / 4`;ui('nearby-count').textContent=entities.filter(e=>e.alive&&e.kind==='enemy'&&dist(e)<400).length;ui('gather-count').textContent=entities.filter(e=>e.alive&&['Moonbloom','Sunberry','Shard'].includes(e.kind)&&dist(e)<300).length;ui('travel-mode').textContent=mounted?(species[team[active].name].mount==='flight'?'IN FLIGHT':species[team[active].name].mount==='swim'?'SWIMMING':'MOUNTED'):keys.has('shift')&&player.moving?'RUNNING':'ON FOOT';ui('coord-text').textContent=`${Math.floor(player.y/20)}° N · ${Math.floor(player.x/20)}° E`;ui('mount-label').textContent=mounted?'DISMOUNT':'MOUNT';renderTeam();updatePrompt();}
function renderTeam(){ui('team-list').innerHTML=team.map((c,i)=>`<div class="creature-row" data-team="${i}"><div class="creature-icon ${species[c.name].element.toLowerCase()}">${species[c.name].icon}</div><div class="creature-detail"><strong>${c.name}${i===active?' <span style="color:#ddc98e;font-size:7px">● ACTIVE</span>':''}</strong><small>${species[c.name].element} · LV ${c.level}</small><div class="creature-health"><i style="width:${100*c.hp/c.maxHp}%"></i></div></div><div class="creature-hp">${c.hp}/${c.maxHp}</div></div>`).join('');}
function updatePrompt(){const e=closest(x=>['Moonbloom','Sunberry','Shard','npc'].includes(x.kind),112);const wild=closest(x=>x.kind==='enemy'&&x.hp<x.maxHp*.72,115);let target=e||wild;const p=ui('interact-prompt');if(target){p.style.display='flex';ui('prompt-text').textContent=target.kind==='npc'?'Speak with Rowan':target.kind==='enemy'?`Invite ${target.species}`:`Gather ${target.kind}`;}else p.style.display='none';}

